    "%@" : {
      "comment" : "Answer to a question from MyBaby. The argument is the string “Night shifts aren't set up. You can plan them in MyBaby, under More, Night shifts.”, the string “%1$arg is on duty now, until %2$arg.”, the string “There are no night shifts planned.”, the string “Tonight, %1$arg is on duty from %2$arg to %3$arg, then %4$arg until %5$arg.”, the string “Tonight, %1$arg is on duty from %2$arg to %3$arg.”, the string “Breastfeeding has been going for %arg, on the left side now.”, the string “Breastfeeding has been going for %arg, on the right side now.”, the string “Breastfeeding has been going for %arg, paused on the left side.”, the string “Breastfeeding has been going for %arg, paused on the right side.”, the string “%1$arg's last feed was %2$arg ago, %3$arg.”, the string “%1$arg's last feed was just now, %2$arg.”, the string “The last feed was %1$arg ago, %2$arg.”, the string “The last feed was just now, %arg.”, the string “%1$arg's last diaper was %2$arg ago, %3$arg.”, the string “%1$arg's last diaper was just now, %2$arg.”, the string “The last diaper was %1$arg ago, %2$arg.”, the string “The last diaper was just now, %arg.”, the string “%1$arg has been asleep for %2$arg, since %3$arg.”, the string “%1$arg is awake. The last sleep ended just now, after %2$arg.”, the string “%1$arg is awake. The last sleep ended %2$arg ago, after %3$arg.”, the string “So far today, %1$arg has had %2$arg and %3$arg, and has slept %4$arg.”, the string “So far today, %1$arg has had %2$arg and %3$arg, and no sleep is logged.”, the string “From what's logged so far today, %1$arg has had %2$arg and %3$arg, and has slept %4$arg.” or the string “From what's logged so far today, %1$arg has had %2$arg and %3$arg, and no sleep is logged.”.",
