            "value" : "Appelez immédiatement le %@ en cas de"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Call %@ right away if %@ has trouble breathing, or swelling of the face, lips or tongue." : {
      "comment" : "The emergency number, then the baby's name",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Llama de inmediato al %@ si %@ tiene dificultad para respirar, o hinchazón de la cara, los labios o la lengua."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Appelez immédiatement le %@ si %@ a du mal à respirer, ou un gonflement du visage, des lèvres ou de la langue."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Call %@, %@" : {
      "comment" : "A phone number, then what it's for\nThe digits, then what the number is for: Call 1 1 2, from a mobile",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Llamar a %1$@, %2$@"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Appeler %1$@, %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Call emergency services if your baby is struggling to breathe, is unusually hard to wake or floppy, has blue or gray lips, or has a seizure. Fever guidance from the American Academy of Pediatrics (AAP). MyBaby isn't medical advice." : {
      "comment" : "Medical safety text: translate faithfully",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Llama a emergencias si tu bebé tiene dificultad para respirar, está inusualmente difícil de despertar o flácido, tiene los labios azules o grises, o tiene una convulsión. Orientación sobre la fiebre de la American Academy of Pediatrics (AAP). MyBaby no es un consejo médico."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Appelez les services d’urgence si votre bébé a du mal à respirer, est anormalement difficile à réveiller ou mou, a les lèvres bleues ou grises, ou fait une convulsion. Conseils sur la fièvre de l’American Academy of Pediatrics (AAP). MyBaby n’est pas un avis médical."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Call your clinic if the sore oozes a lot, the glands in the armpit swell, or it hasn't healed after a few months." : {
      "comment" : "Vaccine guide: a rare reaction to watch for",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Llama a tu clínica si la llaga supura mucho, si se inflaman los ganglios de la axila o si no ha sanado después de unos meses."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Appelez votre clinique si la plaie suinte beaucoup, si les ganglions de l'aisselle enflent, ou si elle n'a pas guéri après quelques mois."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Call your doctor or nurse line for" : {
      "comment" : "Header over a list of reasons to call",
