    },
    "In Glow Baby, choose Export Report › CSV, pick All and the time frame, and export. Glow emails a ZIP of CSV files; save it to Files and pick the ZIP." : {
      "comment" : "How to export from another app. Menu names are the other app's own, in English",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En Glow Baby, elige Export Report › CSV, selecciona All y el periodo, y exporta. Glow envía por correo un ZIP con archivos CSV; guárdalo en Archivos y elige el ZIP."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dans Glow Baby, choisissez Export Report › CSV, sélectionnez All et la période, puis exportez. Glow envoie par courriel un ZIP de fichiers CSV ; enregistrez-le dans Fichiers et choisissez le ZIP."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Huckleberry, open the child's profile and choose Export tracking data as CSV. The link arrives by email; save the file to Files first." : {
      "comment" : "How to export from another app. Menu names are the other app's own, in English",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En Huckleberry, abre el perfil del bebé y elige Export tracking data as CSV. El enlace llega por correo; primero guarda el archivo en Archivos."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dans Huckleberry, ouvrez le profil de l'enfant et choisissez Export tracking data as CSV. Le lien arrive par courriel ; enregistrez d'abord le fichier dans Fichiers."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Nara Baby, go to Activity, tap the child's picture, then Export Data. Save the CSV to Files." : {
      "comment" : "How to export from another app. Menu names are the other app's own, in English",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En Nara Baby, ve a Activity, toca la foto del bebé y luego Export Data. Guarda el CSV en Archivos."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dans Nara Baby, allez dans Activity, touchez la photo de l'enfant, puis Export Data. Enregistrez le CSV dans Fichiers."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In progress" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En curso"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En cours"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In some countries, or for some babies" : {
      "comment" : "Vaccine guide: group of vaccines",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En algunos países, o para algunos bebés"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dans certains pays, ou pour certains bébés"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "in the freezer" : {
      "comment" : "Siri: where pumped milk was put in the stash, as in: added it to the stash in the freezer",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "en el congelador"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "au congélateur"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "in the fridge" : {
      "comment" : "Siri: where pumped milk was put in the stash, as in: added it to the stash in the fridge",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "en el refrigerador"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "au réfrigérateur"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In the unit chosen in MyBaby's Settings, milliliters or ounces." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En la unidad elegida en los ajustes de MyBaby, mililitros u onzas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dans l'unité choisie dans les réglages de MyBaby, millilitres ou onces."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In the US, the CDC's schedule changed in 2026, the change was challenged in court, and the American Academy of Pediatrics publishes its own. Ask your pediatrician which schedule they follow." : {
      "comment" : "Vaccine guide: note for the United States",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En EE. UU., el calendario de los CDC cambió en 2026, el cambio se impugnó en los tribunales y la Academia Americana de Pediatría publica el suyo. Pregúntale a tu pediatra qué calendario sigue."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aux États-Unis, le calendrier des CDC a changé en 2026, ce changement a été contesté en justice, et l'Académie américaine de pédiatrie publie son propre calendrier. Demandez à votre pédiatre quel calendrier il ou elle suit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In your iCloud" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En tu iCloud"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dans votre iCloud"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Include letters for later" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Incluir las cartas para después"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Inclure les lettres pour plus tard"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Include technical details" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Incluir detalles técnicos"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Inclure les détails techniques"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Includes the questions you saved for the next visit." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Incluye las preguntas que guardaste para la próxima consulta."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Comprend les questions que vous avez gardées pour la prochaine visite."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Influenza (Flu)" : {
      "comment" : "Vaccine name. Use the official name and abbreviation.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Influenza (gripe)"
          }
        },
