    "Rotavirus (RV)" : {
      "comment" : "Vaccine name. Use the official name and abbreviation.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rotavirus (RV)"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rotavirus (Rota)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rotavirus can dehydrate a baby quickly. This one is drops in the mouth, not a shot. It has to be started young, so it's given in the first months and not started late." : {
      "comment" : "Vaccine guide: about the rotavirus vaccine",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El rotavirus puede deshidratar rápidamente a un bebé. Esta vacuna se da en gotas por la boca, no en inyección. Hay que empezarla temprano, así que se da en los primeros meses y no se empieza tarde."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le rotavirus peut déshydrater un bébé rapidement. Ce vaccin se donne en gouttes dans la bouche, pas en injection. Il doit être commencé tôt : on le donne dans les premiers mois, et on ne le commence pas tard."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rotavirus, which causes severe diarrhea and vomiting" : {
      "comment" : "Vaccine guide: what the vaccine protects against",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El rotavirus, que causa diarrea y vómitos graves"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le rotavirus, qui cause une diarrhée et des vomissements graves"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rough guess: not much logged yet" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Estimación aproximada: aún hay pocos registros"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Estimation approximative : encore peu de données"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rows are recognized from words like bottle, formula, breastfeed, nursing, wet, dirty, nap, pump, bath, temperature or a medicine's name. Rows MyBaby can't tell are skipped and counted." : {
      "comment" : "The words are what the importer looks for in the file, which are in English, so keep them in English.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las filas se reconocen por palabras en inglés como bottle, formula, breastfeed, nursing, wet, dirty, nap, pump, bath, temperature o el nombre de un medicamento. Las filas que MyBaby no reconoce se omiten y se cuentan."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les lignes sont reconnues grâce à des mots anglais comme bottle, formula, breastfeed, nursing, wet, dirty, nap, pump, bath, temperature ou le nom d'un médicament. Les lignes que MyBaby ne reconnaît pas sont ignorées et comptées."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rows with a date MyBaby couldn't read" : {
      "comment" : "Import preview: why rows were left out",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Filas con una fecha que MyBaby no pudo leer"
